{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06576","headline":"题崔山人别业 · 储光羲","name":"题崔山人别业","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"南阳隐居者，筑室丹溪源。\n溪冷惧秋[晏]，室寒欣景暾。\n山鸡鸣菌阁，水雾入衡门。\n东岭或舒啸，北窗时讨论。\n封君渭阳竹，逸士汉阴园。\n何必崆峒上，独爲尧所尊。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"储光羲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06576.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06576","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}